{"mode":"words","text":"Dabar klausykis teksto ir tuo pačiu skaityk kartu. Jei esi pradedantysis, skaityk reikšmės eilutę savo gimtąja kalba, klausykis tikslinės kalbos lėtai ir dažnai spausk „Pauzė“ — taip tavo smegenys susies garsą su reikšme. Jei esi pažengęs, skaityk originalų tekstą ir tik sutikęs nežinomų žodžių trumpai pažvelk žemyn. Dažnai naudok A-B kartojimą: pažymėk vieną sakinį ir paleisk jį kartojimo režimu — išbandyk tai viršuje.","words":[{"s":0,"e":320},{"s":380,"e":800},{"s":840,"e":1120},{"s":1147,"e":1200},{"s":1240,"e":1360},{"s":1387,"e":1600},{"s":1640,"e":2080},{"s":2112,"e":2560},{"s":2880,"e":3640},{"s":3670,"e":3760},{"s":3787,"e":4920},{"s":4970,"e":5360},{"s":5387,"e":5800},{"s":5820,"e":6240},{"s":6280,"e":6520},{"s":6550,"e":6880},{"s":6960,"e":7520},{"s":7680,"e":8400},{"s":8440,"e":8960},{"s":9000,"e":9360},{"s":9400,"e":9920},{"s":10080,"e":10400},{"s":10427,"e":10720},{"s":10747,"e":11040},{"s":11120,"e":11600},{"s":11840,"e":12080},{"s":12107,"e":12240},{"s":12280,"e":12480},{"s":12533,"e":13040},{"s":13080,"e":13440},{"s":13480,"e":13920},{"s":13973,"e":14080},{"s":14133,"e":14720},{"s":15120,"e":16000},{"s":16040,"e":16160},{"s":16240,"e":17160},{"s":17230,"e":17600},{"s":17662,"e":18480},{"s":18507,"e":18880},{"s":18987,"e":19200},{"s":19240,"e":19360},{"s":19400,"e":19760},{"s":19820,"e":20400},{"s":20440,"e":20853},{"s":20871,"e":21120},{"s":21147,"e":21520},{"s":21560,"e":22000},{"s":22400,"e":23440},{"s":23467,"e":23840},{"s":23960,"e":24320},{"s":24560,"e":25880},{"s":25920,"e":26140},{"s":26160,"e":26480},{"s":26520,"e":27320},{"s":27413,"e":27600},{"s":27664,"e":28160},{"s":28200,"e":28440},{"s":28464,"e":28880},{"s":28920,"e":29360},{"s":29720,"e":30080},{"s":30120,"e":30640},{"s":30660,"e":30720},{"s":30760,"e":31360}]}